# Screenshots Directory

Add your project screenshots here after running the project.

## Required Screenshots

| Filename | What to Capture |
|---|---|
| `docker_desktop.png` | Docker Desktop showing all containers running |
| `containers_running.png` | Terminal output of `docker compose ps` |
| `n8n_dashboard.png` | n8n workflow dashboard/home screen |
| `workflow_canvas.png` | Full workflow canvas (zoom out to show all nodes) |
| `planner_node.png` | AI Planner node configuration and output |
| `memory_node.png` | Qdrant memory retrieval node |
| `gmail_trigger.png` | Gmail Trigger node settings |
| `ai_reply.png` | AI-generated reply in the execution log |
| `approval_node.png` | Approval webhook node waiting for input |
| `email_sent.png` | Successful email sent confirmation |
| `logs_folder.png` | Generated markdown logs in the logs/ folder |
| `qdrant_dashboard.png` | Qdrant dashboard showing stored vectors |

## How to Take Screenshots

1. Start all services: `docker compose up -d`
2. Open n8n at http://localhost:5678
3. Import the workflow from `workflows/email_responder.json`
4. Activate the workflow
5. Send a test email to your Gmail inbox
6. Watch the workflow execute and capture each step
